<section class="hero" style="padding: 8rem 0 6rem; text-align: center; position: relative;">
    <div style="position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); width: 300px; height: 300px; background: var(--signal-cyan); filter: blur(150px); opacity: 0.1; pointer-events: none; z-index: -1;"></div>
    
    <h1 style="font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 15px; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff 0%, var(--signal-cyan) 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; line-height: 1; font-size: 5rem;">
        PULSE
    </h1>
    <p class="text-soft glow-text" style="font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto 3.5rem; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600;">
        The Community Health Layer for Web3. <br> 
        <span style="font-size: 0.9rem; opacity: 0.7; letter-spacing: 4px;">REAL-TIME INTELLIGENCE OPERATING SYSTEM</span>
    </p>
    
    <div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;">
        <form action="/dashboard" method="GET" id="telemetry-form" style="display: flex; gap: 0.5rem; background: var(--glass-bg); padding: 0.5rem; border: 1px solid var(--glass-border); border-radius: 4px;">
            <input type="text" name="daoId" placeholder="ENTER_TARGET_DAO_ID (e.g. stacks-foundation)" required 
                style="flex: 1; background: transparent; border: none; color: var(--signal-cyan); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; outline: none;">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.5rem 1.5rem;">LINK</button>
        </form>
        <p class="text-soft mono" style="font-size: 0.6rem; margin-top: 1rem; letter-spacing: 2px;">AWAITING_TARGET_IDENTIFIER...</p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 0 1rem;">
        <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-outline" style="padding: 1.2rem 3rem;">Global Intelligence</a>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.getElementById('telemetry-form').onsubmit = function(e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            const daoId = this.daoId.value.trim().replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9_-]/g, '');
            if(daoId) {
                // First, trigger the health fetch to ensure data exists
                fetch(`/api/health/${daoId}`)
                    .then(() => window.location.href = `/dashboard/${daoId}`);
            }
        };
    </script>
</section>

<section id="about" class="grid-3" style="margin-top: 6rem; position: relative;">
    <div class="glass-panel" style="border-top: 2px solid var(--signal-cyan);">
        <div class="mono text-cyan" style="font-size: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">[01] THE_PROBLEM</div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Invisible Decay</h3>
        <p class="text-soft" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8;">DAOs are complex digital organisms. Community decay often happens in the shadows, invisible until momentum collapses. Standard dashboards fail to capture the vital signs of participation.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="glass-panel" style="border-top: 2px solid var(--status-warning);">
        <div class="mono text-warning" style="font-size: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">[02] THE_INSIGHT</div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Deterministic Vitality</h3>
        <p class="text-soft" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8;">Activity velocity, retention, and engagement diversity are the heartbeat of decentralized civilizations. By quantifying these metrics, PULSE predicts stability and burnout before they manifest.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="glass-panel" style="border-top: 2px solid var(--status-healthy);">
        <div class="mono text-healthy" style="font-size: 0.7rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">[03] THE_SOLUTION</div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Real-time Monitoring</h3>
        <p class="text-soft" style="font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.8;">A high-fidelity ICU monitoring system for DAOs. Real-time health scores, contributor momentum tracking, and AI-synthesized intelligence derived from verified on-chain activity.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section style="margin-top: 10rem; margin-bottom: 6rem;">
    <div class="glass-panel" style="text-align: center; border: 1px dashed var(--glass-border); padding: 5rem 2rem; position: relative; overflow: hidden;">
        <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--signal-cyan), transparent); animation: scan 3s infinite;"></div>
        
        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: 8px;">OPERATIONAL_READINESS</h2>
        <p class="text-soft mono" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 2px;">ZERO_AUTHORITY_NETWORK: CONNECTED | UPTIME: 99.9% | ENGINE_V3: ONLINE</p>
        
        <div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
            <p class="text-soft" style="margin-bottom: 3rem; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8;">The PULSE Intelligence Engine is fully synchronized with the Zero Authority network. Initialize live tracking to begin monitoring community vitality.</p>
            <a href="/dashboard" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Initialize Live Telemetry</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
